{"id":"91189e210bff4156","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-heyting-algebra.md","title":"Definition — Heyting Algebra","display":"Definition — Heyting Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-heyting-algebra","aliases":["14-df-heyting-algebra"],"display":"Definition — Heyting Algebra","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-heyting-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-heyting-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Heyting Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(H\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\\subseteq H^2\">\\(\\leq\\subseteq H^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow:H^2\\to H\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow:H^2\\to H\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\top\\in H\">\\(\\bot,\\top\\in H\\)</span>。全结构记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb H=(H,\\leq,\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow,\\bot,\\top)\">\\(\\mathbb H=(H,\\leq,\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow,\\bot,\\top)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(H)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(H)\\)</span> 是结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb H\">\\(\\mathbb H\\)</span> 已绑定时的省略记号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathbb H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\forall a\\in H\\ (a\\leq a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in H\\ ((a\\leq b\\land b\\leq a)\\to a=b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in H\\ ((a\\leq b\\land b\\leq c)\\to a\\leq c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in H\\ (\\bot\\leq a\\land a\\leq\\top)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in H\\ \\bigl((c\\leq a\\wedge b\\leftrightarrow(c\\leq a\\land c\\leq b))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\land(a\\vee b\\leq c\\leftrightarrow(a\\leq c\\land b\\leq c))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\land(c\\leq(a\\Rightarrow b)\\leftrightarrow c\\wedge a\\leq b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathbb H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\forall a\\in H\\ (a\\leq a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in H\\ ((a\\leq b\\land b\\leq a)\\to a=b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in H\\ ((a\\leq b\\land b\\leq c)\\to a\\leq c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in H\\ (\\bot\\leq a\\land a\\leq\\top)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in H\\ \\bigl((c\\leq a\\wedge b\\leftrightarrow(c\\leq a\\land c\\leq b))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\land(a\\vee b\\leq c\\leftrightarrow(a\\leq c\\land b\\leq c))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\land(c\\leq(a\\Rightarrow b)\\leftrightarrow c\\wedge a\\leq b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.8 Heyting Algebras，印刷页 50–56。旧定义漏偏序公理：两元素集合上取全关系，全部等价式会退化为真，不能定义 Heyting 代数。修订明确结构参数及反身、反对称、传递性。蕴涵的右伴随性质推出分配律，故无需另加冗余的分配公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"H\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq\\subseteq H^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow:H^2\\to H","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\top\\in H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb H=(H,\\leq,\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow,\\bot,\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb H","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathbb H)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\forall a\\in H\\ (a\\leq a)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in H\\ ((a\\leq b\\land b\\leq a)\\to a=b)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in H\\ ((a\\leq b\\land b\\leq c)\\to a\\leq c)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in H\\ (\\bot\\leq a\\land a\\leq\\top)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in H\\ \\bigl((c\\leq a\\wedge b\\leftrightarrow(c\\leq a\\land c\\leq b))\\\\\n&\\hspace{17mm}\\land(a\\vee b\\leq c\\leftrightarrow(a\\leq c\\land b\\leq c))\\\\\n&\\hspace{17mm}\\land(c\\leq(a\\Rightarrow b)\\leftrightarrow c\\wedge a\\leq b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1525,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-algebra|Definition — Heyting Algebra]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-algebra]]"},{"id":"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ec7ec2b1e34cb9f0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-algebra]]"},{"id":"0b6a2f7cb930ac02","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c1caa9c6c6dfe850","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-algebra|Definition — Heyting Algebra]]"},{"id":"89152b1252304fa8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5aa17e379c0e3bc4","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，$X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。子对象序见 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]；$\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)=(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X),\\leq_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X,\\bot_X,\\top_X)$ 是 [[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]] 的结构。$\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X))$ 在本书表示该已绑定全结构满足 [[14-df-heyting-algebra]]；后文省略运算下标。"}],"outgoing":["28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}